            <div class="news-item">
                <div class="news-date">2024-01-15</div>
                <div class="news-content">
                    <h3>Major Championship Announced</h3>
                    <p>The next CS:GO Major will take place in Paris with a $2 million prize pool.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="news-item">
                <div class="news-date">2024-01-10</div>
                <div class="news-content">
                    <h3>New Operation Released</h3>
                    <p>Operation Riptide brings new maps, skins, and missions to CS:GO.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
